# Line endings are declared here so a checkout matches what the tooling writes.
#
# Without this, `core.autocrlf=true` (the Windows default) checks text files out as CRLF while ruff, prettier,
# the i18n extractor and the OpenAPI generator all write LF. Every one of those then looks like an uncommitted
# change on a clean tree, and the i18n check reported a stale catalogue for a file whose keys were identical.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary: never touch these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.mp4 binary
*.pdf binary
